  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I oktober skickade APAD en f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan till Sida om svenskt st&#xf6;d till projektet &quot;Building capacity for Human Resource Departments&quot;. Sida har uppdragit SPM Consultants att g&#xf6;ra en bed&#xf6;mning av projektets relevans, ev. samarbetsm&#xf6;jligheter med norge samt ta fram ett underlag f&#xf6;r en internationell upphandling av genomf&#xf6;randet av ett projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2001 APAD sent a request to Sida for Swedish support tp the project &quot;Building Capacity for Human Resource Departments&quot;. Sida has comissioned SPM Consultants to assess; the relevance of the activity, possibilities to cooperate with Norway and to finalise a ToR that can be used in an international bidding for implementation of a project.</narrative>
  </description>
